  "about": "What Apache Kafka's own MemoryRecords reader recovered from batches THIS repository compressed. Unlike vectors.json the `hex` here is not Kafka's: it is the output under judgement, pinned so a later comparison is against bytes Kafka actually saw. Regenerate with `cargo xtask records --refresh`.",
